10	- [ ] **Step 1: Append the header and footer layer**
11	
12	Note the mobile strategy: `header nav` is `flex: 0 1 auto` with `margin-left: auto`, so it right-aligns on wide screens and *shrinks into a horizontally scroll-snapped strip* on narrow ones. It stays a single row at every width, which is what lets `.page-container` use one constant top padding instead of the old 110 / 135 / 145px ladder — and it adds no DOM.
13	
14	```css
15	/* ==========================================================================
16	   4. HEADER, NAV & FOOTER
17	   ========================================================================== */
18	header {
19	    position: fixed;
20	    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
21	    z-index: 1000;
22	    background: rgba(15, 42, 46, .94);
23	    -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(140%) blur(10px);
24	    backdrop-filter: saturate(140%) blur(10px);
25	    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(224, 164, 88, .14);
26	}
27	
28	.header-container {
29	    max-width: var(--wrap);
30	    margin: 0 auto;
31	    min-height: var(--header-h);
32	    padding: 0 var(--s5);
33	    display: flex;
34	    align-items: center;
35	    gap: var(--s4);
36	}
37	
38	.logo {
39	    flex: none;
40	    font-family: var(--font-display);
41	    font-size: 1.35rem;
42	    font-weight: 700;
43	    letter-spacing: -.01em;
44	    color: #FFFFFF;
45	    text-decoration: none;
46	    white-space: nowrap;
47	}
48	
49	.logo:hover { color: #FFFFFF; }
50	.logo span { color: var(--accent-on-ink); }
51	
52	header nav {
53	    flex: 0 1 auto;
54	    min-width: 0;
55	    margin-left: auto;
56	    padding: var(--s3) 0;
57	    display: flex;
58	    align-items: center;
59	    gap: var(--s1);
60	    overflow-x: auto;
61	    overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
62	    scroll-snap-type: x proximity;
63	    scrollbar-width: none;
64	    -ms-overflow-style: none;
65	}
66	
67	header nav::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
68	
69	header nav > * {
70	    flex: none;
71	    scroll-snap-align: end;
72	}
73	
74	header nav a {
75	    padding: 9px 13px;
76	    border-radius: var(--r-sm);
77	    color: var(--text-on-ink-2);
78	    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
79	    font-weight: 600;
80	    text-decoration: none;
81	    white-space: nowrap;
82	    transition: color var(--t-fast), background-color var(--t-fast);
83	}
84	
85	header nav a:hover {
86	    color: #FFFFFF;
87	    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .07);
88	}
89	
90	header nav a.active {
91	    color: var(--accent-on-ink);
92	    background-color: rgba(224, 164, 88, .12);
93	}
94	
95	header nav a.btn-nav {
96	    margin-left: var(--s2);
97	    background-color: var(--accent);
98	    color: #FFFFFF;
99	    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .12);
100	}
101	
102	header nav a.btn-nav:hover,
103	header nav a.btn-nav.active {
104	    background-color: var(--accent-hover);
105	    color: #FFFFFF;
106	}
107	
108	.lang-select {
109	    flex: none;
110	    margin-left: var(--s2);
111	    padding: 8px 10px;
112	    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .06);
113	    color: #FFFFFF;
114	    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .18);
115	    border-radius: var(--r-sm);
116	    font-family: var(--font-sans);
117	    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
118	    font-weight: 600;
119	    line-height: 1;
120	    cursor: pointer;
121	    transition: border-color var(--t-fast), background-color var(--t-fast);
122	}
123	
124	.lang-select:hover {
125	    border-color: var(--accent-on-ink);
126	    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .10);
127	}
128	
129	.lang-select option {
130	    background-color: var(--ink);
131	    color: #FFFFFF;
132	}
133	
134	footer {
135	    margin-top: auto;
136	    padding: var(--s6) var(--s5);
137	    background-color: var(--ink);
138	    color: var(--text-on-ink-2);
139	    border-top: 1px solid rgba(224, 164, 88, .14);
140	    text-align: center;
141	    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
142	}
143	
144	.footer-content {
145	    max-width: var(--wrap);
146	    margin: 0 auto;
147	}
